{"about_the_game":"<strong>Soul of Butterflies: Incubation Original Soundtrack is composed by \u4ec1\u5b50Ninko and Inverted Sun/RNG Silvercraft.</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Background story</h2><br><br>In the &quot;Republic of Darkcone,&quot; a country that has experienced multiple changes in political power, the people continue to suffer from the ravages of war. At this time, an outbreak of a mysterious infectious disease has once again thrust them into the brink of survival.<br><br>The protagonist of the story is named &quot;Anders.&quot; In order to raise the necessary medical funds for his ailing sister &quot;Nara,&quot; he accepts a mysterious job invitation from the &quot;Butterfly Inn.&quot; Little does he know that his inner struggles and fears will become a significant test before he embarks on an irreversible adventure\u2026<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2683750/extras/c2c60898c6494025cbe72b37be8b0f19.poster.avif?t=1745580314\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2683750/extras/c2c60898c6494025cbe72b37be8b0f19.webm?t=1745580314\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2683750/extras/c2c60898c6494025cbe72b37be8b0f19.mp4?t=1745580314\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2683750?t=1745580314","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2683750?t=1745580314","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2683750/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745580314","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2683750/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745580314","content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_de